<.accordion class="w-full max-w-md">
  <.accordion_item open>
    <.accordion_trigger>Is it accessible?</.accordion_trigger>
    <.accordion_content>
      Yes. It is built on native &lt;details&gt; and &lt;summary&gt; elements.
    </.accordion_content>
  </.accordion_item>
  <.accordion_item>
    <.accordion_trigger>Does it need JavaScript?</.accordion_trigger>
    <.accordion_content>
      No. The open and close behavior works with zero JavaScript.
    </.accordion_content>
  </.accordion_item>
  <.accordion_item>
    <.accordion_trigger>Is it styled?</.accordion_trigger>
    <.accordion_content>
      Yes. It comes with default styles that match the rest of the components.
    </.accordion_content>
  </.accordion_item>
</.accordion>
